{
  "id": "RAW_eeb91b91c7",
  "title": "域名结账后的新设置页面 - Vercel",
  "url": "https://vercel.com/changelog/new-setup-page-after-domain-checkout",
  "date": "2026-08-06 01:00:00",
  "author": "Can Temizyurek",
  "siteName": "Vercel News",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-initial flex-col items-center justify-start gap-6 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap\" data-customer-story=\"false\">\n   <div class=\"w-full max-w-(--article-max-width) contents [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;&gt;h2:first-child]:!pt-0 [&amp;&gt;h3:first-child]:!pt-0 [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:w-full [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:max-w-none [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:self-stretch\" data-blog-body=\"true\">\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Buying a domain on Vercel now takes you to a setup page that tracks registration live, with direct paths to deploy a new project, connect an existing one, proxy or redirect a site you already run, or set up email.</p>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 max-w-none not-first:my-10 mx-0 max-[600px]:max-w-none max-[600px]:px-7 max-[600px]:in-[li]:pr-14 max-[600px]:in-[li]:pl-0 max-[600px]:w-full max-[600px]:mt-12 max-[600px]:mb-6\">\n     <div class=\"rounded-md p-2 bg-background-100 shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] bg-clip-padding max-w-[800px] sm:border-l-0 sm:border-r-0 sm:border-(--guide-color) sm:w-full\">\n      <img data-version=\"v1\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"[.dark-theme_&amp;]:hidden! h-auto max-w-full p-3 @max-[860px]:p-0 @max-[860px]:w-[var(--article-full-width)]\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcset=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/2Vh0cthbeTKpjT5PRCn0UI/f8e4e73503838bb1e089eaf43f2420b1/1b.png 1x, https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/2Vh0cthbeTKpjT5PRCn0UI/f8e4e73503838bb1e089eaf43f2420b1/1b.png 2x\" src=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/2Vh0cthbeTKpjT5PRCn0UI/f8e4e73503838bb1e089eaf43f2420b1/1b.png\"><img data-version=\"v1\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"[.light-theme_&amp;]:hidden! h-auto max-w-full p-3 @max-[860px]:p-0 @max-[860px]:w-[var(--article-full-width)]\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcset=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/3Lve7qYEb5nqTR8bxCjX0d/2c2c5c2e85915cc1ecb4a1fb1327dba6/1.png 1x, https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/3Lve7qYEb5nqTR8bxCjX0d/2c2c5c2e85915cc1ecb4a1fb1327dba6/1.png 2x\" src=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/3Lve7qYEb5nqTR8bxCjX0d/2c2c5c2e85915cc1ecb4a1fb1327dba6/1.png\">\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Registration can take a few minutes. Each setup action unlocks as soon as the domain is ready. If registration fails, the page shows what went wrong and the status of your refund.</p>\n    <h2 class=\"pt-[calc(var(--grid-divider-gap)/1.5)] in-[#changelog-description]:pt-6 text-heading-32 font-normal! leading-[1.1]! [&amp;:has(_b)]:text-gray-900 [&amp;_b]:font-normal [&amp;_b]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap group relative w-full text-balance\"><a class=\"scroll-mt-[90px] flex items-center justify-center flex-col absolute left-0 bottom-0 mt-auto mb-auto w-8 h-[1lh] max-h-8 rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 -translate-x-full duration-100 transition-all text-gray-900 hover:text-gray-1000 focus-visible:opacity-100\" href=\"#deploy-a-new-project-or-connect-an-existing-one\" id=\"deploy-a-new-project-or-connect-an-existing-one\"> \n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" data-slot=\"geist-icon\" style=\"color:currentColor\">\n       <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.47 1.47a4.29 4.29 0 1 1 6.06 6.06l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06 2.5-2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 0-3.94-3.94l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06zm3.06 4.06-6 6-1.06-1.06 6-6zm-10.06 9a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 6.06 0l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 1-3.94-3.94l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 0 6.06\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n      </svg> \n      <span class=\"sr-only\">Copy link to heading</span> \n     </a>Deploy a new project or connect an existing one</h2>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\"><b>Deploy something</b> opens project creation with the domain preselected. Connect a Git repository, prompt with <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);font-feature-settings:&quot;tnum&quot;\">v0</span>, or start from a template, and the domain is attached when the project deploys.<!-- --></p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\"><b>Connect an existing project</b> attaches the domain to a project you pick from your team.</p>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 max-w-none not-first:my-10 mx-0 max-[600px]:max-w-none max-[600px]:px-7 max-[600px]:in-[li]:pr-14 max-[600px]:in-[li]:pl-0 max-[600px]:w-full max-[600px]:mt-12 max-[600px]:mb-6\">\n     <div class=\"rounded-md p-2 bg-background-100 shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] bg-clip-padding max-w-[800px] sm:border-l-0 sm:border-r-0 sm:border-(--guide-color) sm:w-full\">\n      <img data-version=\"v1\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"[.dark-theme_&amp;]:hidden! h-auto max-w-full p-3 @max-[860px]:p-0 @max-[860px]:w-[var(--article-full-width)]\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcset=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/6KG2GtT19EOAcPT7FfRStt/74384bb3c4e9c55155820a4877cf5fc4/2b.png 1x, https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/6KG2GtT19EOAcPT7FfRStt/74384bb3c4e9c55155820a4877cf5fc4/2b.png 2x\" src=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/6KG2GtT19EOAcPT7FfRStt/74384bb3c4e9c55155820a4877cf5fc4/2b.png\"><img data-version=\"v1\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"[.light-theme_&amp;]:hidden! h-auto max-w-full p-3 @max-[860px]:p-0 @max-[860px]:w-[var(--article-full-width)]\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcset=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/1TMpvl5KrC1mJ7SjyLmA4K/2bb61488ea7786e350a7d3a474a788ce/2.png 1x, https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/1TMpvl5KrC1mJ7SjyLmA4K/2bb61488ea7786e350a7d3a474a788ce/2.png 2x\" src=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/1TMpvl5KrC1mJ7SjyLmA4K/2bb61488ea7786e350a7d3a474a788ce/2.png\">\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <h2 class=\"pt-[calc(var(--grid-divider-gap)/1.5)] in-[#changelog-description]:pt-6 text-heading-32 font-normal! leading-[1.1]! [&amp;:has(_b)]:text-gray-900 [&amp;_b]:font-normal [&amp;_b]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap group relative w-full text-balance\"><a class=\"scroll-mt-[90px] flex items-center justify-center flex-col absolute left-0 bottom-0 mt-auto mb-auto w-8 h-[1lh] max-h-8 rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 -translate-x-full duration-100 transition-all text-gray-900 hover:text-gray-1000 focus-visible:opacity-100\" href=\"#proxy-or-redirect-a-site-you-already-run\" id=\"proxy-or-redirect-a-site-you-already-run\"> \n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" data-slot=\"geist-icon\" style=\"color:currentColor\">\n       <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.47 1.47a4.29 4.29 0 1 1 6.06 6.06l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06 2.5-2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 0-3.94-3.94l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06zm3.06 4.06-6 6-1.06-1.06 6-6zm-10.06 9a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 6.06 0l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 1-3.94-3.94l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 0 6.06\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n      </svg> \n      <span class=\"sr-only\">Copy link to heading</span> \n     </a>Proxy or redirect a site you already run</h2>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Enter an origin to proxy, and traffic to the domain routes through Vercel's CDN and Firewall to your existing site. Enter a URL to redirect, and visitors are forwarded there. In both cases, Vercel creates a project to handle the routing and configures it for you.</p>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 max-w-none not-first:my-10 mx-0 max-[600px]:max-w-none max-[600px]:px-7 max-[600px]:in-[li]:pr-14 max-[600px]:in-[li]:pl-0 max-[600px]:w-full max-[600px]:mt-12 max-[600px]:mb-6\">\n     <div class=\"rounded-md p-2 bg-background-100 shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] bg-clip-padding max-w-[800px] sm:border-l-0 sm:border-r-0 sm:border-(--guide-color) sm:w-full\">\n      <img data-version=\"v1\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"[.dark-theme_&amp;]:hidden! h-auto max-w-full p-3 @max-[860px]:p-0 @max-[860px]:w-[var(--article-full-width)]\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcset=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/2WW0WsqI7jTrF5ea9OdD2Y/0e2229a5059c76509b5cfcd7cb137d02/3b.png 1x, https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/2WW0WsqI7jTrF5ea9OdD2Y/0e2229a5059c76509b5cfcd7cb137d02/3b.png 2x\" src=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/2WW0WsqI7jTrF5ea9OdD2Y/0e2229a5059c76509b5cfcd7cb137d02/3b.png\"><img data-version=\"v1\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"[.light-theme_&amp;]:hidden! h-auto max-w-full p-3 @max-[860px]:p-0 @max-[860px]:w-[var(--article-full-width)]\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcset=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/gynQLFJwFBjpZmY4aJwF2/ea17b62d3293a2508d623b9240fc553d/3.png 1x, https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/gynQLFJwFBjpZmY4aJwF2/ea17b62d3293a2508d623b9240fc553d/3.png 2x\" src=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/gynQLFJwFBjpZmY4aJwF2/ea17b62d3293a2508d623b9240fc553d/3.png\">\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <h2 class=\"pt-[calc(var(--grid-divider-gap)/1.5)] in-[#changelog-description]:pt-6 text-heading-32 font-normal! leading-[1.1]! [&amp;:has(_b)]:text-gray-900 [&amp;_b]:font-normal [&amp;_b]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap group relative w-full text-balance\"><a class=\"scroll-mt-[90px] flex items-center justify-center flex-col absolute left-0 bottom-0 mt-auto mb-auto w-8 h-[1lh] max-h-8 rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 -translate-x-full duration-100 transition-all text-gray-900 hover:text-gray-1000 focus-visible:opacity-100\" href=\"#set-up-email-with-dns-presets\" id=\"set-up-email-with-dns-presets\"> \n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" data-slot=\"geist-icon\" style=\"color:currentColor\">\n       <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.47 1.47a4.29 4.29 0 1 1 6.06 6.06l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06 2.5-2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 0-3.94-3.94l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06zm3.06 4.06-6 6-1.06-1.06 6-6zm-10.06 9a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 6.06 0l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 1-3.94-3.94l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 0 6.06\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n      </svg> \n      <span class=\"sr-only\">Copy link to heading</span> \n     </a>Set up email with DNS presets</h2>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Choose your email provider and Vercel adds the DNS records it needs. Presets are available for Google Workspace, Outlook, iCloud, Proton Mail, Zoho, Mailgun, and ImprovMX. There's also a preset for using the domain as your Bluesky handle.</p>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 max-w-none not-first:my-10 mx-0 max-[600px]:max-w-none max-[600px]:px-7 max-[600px]:in-[li]:pr-14 max-[600px]:in-[li]:pl-0 max-[600px]:w-full max-[600px]:mt-12 max-[600px]:mb-6\">\n     <div class=\"rounded-md p-2 bg-background-100 shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] bg-clip-padding max-w-[800px] sm:border-l-0 sm:border-r-0 sm:border-(--guide-color) sm:w-full\">\n      <img data-version=\"v1\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"[.dark-theme_&amp;]:hidden! h-auto max-w-full p-3 @max-[860px]:p-0 @max-[860px]:w-[var(--article-full-width)]\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcset=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/2wQWlOXc9gGTttmhqXmbTj/6ede81169f3da74c5c55969054e9da96/4b.png 1x, https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/2wQWlOXc9gGTttmhqXmbTj/6ede81169f3da74c5c55969054e9da96/4b.png 2x\" src=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/2wQWlOXc9gGTttmhqXmbTj/6ede81169f3da74c5c55969054e9da96/4b.png\"><img data-version=\"v1\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"[.light-theme_&amp;]:hidden! h-auto max-w-full p-3 @max-[860px]:p-0 @max-[860px]:w-[var(--article-full-width)]\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcset=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/52PttYWZ8i5oCLkRfGOQg/a94ba55759ff294710fe88c7d6cec916/4.png 1x, https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/52PttYWZ8i5oCLkRfGOQg/a94ba55759ff294710fe88c7d6cec916/4.png 2x\" src=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/52PttYWZ8i5oCLkRfGOQg/a94ba55759ff294710fe88c7d6cec916/4.png\">\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">If you'd rather configure records yourself, <b>Manage DNS records </b>opens the domain's DNS records page.\n     <br>\n     <span class=\"block h-4\"></span>Search for a domain at <a href=\"https://vercel.com/domains\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_self\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://vercel.com/domains\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-[var(--geist-link-color)] [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:underline [&amp;_u]:no-underline underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 text-inherit! hover:decoration-1! hover:text-(--geist-link-color)! focus-visible:outline-offset-2\">vercel.com/domains</a> to get started.\n     <br>\n     <span class=\"block h-4\"></span></p>\n   </div>\n   <section class=\"w-full max-w-(--article-max-width) flex flex-col gap-4 mt-6\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-label-14 font-medium\">Contributors</h2>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-gray-900\">\n     <p class=\"text-copy-14 text-pretty\"><a href=\"https://github.com/kevinsundstrom\" rel=\"author\" target=\"_blank\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 hover:underline\">Kevin Sundstrom</a></p>\n    </div>\n   </section>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Vercel 推出新的结账后设置页面，实时跟踪域名注册状态，并提供引导路径以部署项目、代理或重定向现有站点，以及使用 DNS 预设配置邮箱。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Vercel 推出新的结账后设置页面，实时跟踪域名注册状态，并提供引导路径以部署项目、代理或重定向现有站点，以及使用 DNS 预设配置邮箱。",
  "summary": "Vercel 的新域名设置页面在购买后立即出现，显示实时注册状态，并在域名就绪时解锁配置选项。用户可以部署新项目（域名预选中）、连接现有项目、通过 Vercel 的 CDN 和防火墙将流量代理到外部源站、将访问者重定向到另一个 URL，或使用 Google Workspace、Outlook、iCloud、Proton Mail、Zoho、Mailgun、ImprovMX 和 Bluesky 句柄等提供商的 DNS 预设来设置邮箱。如果注册失败，页面会显示错误和退款状态。并提供“管理 DNS 记录”链接以进行手动配置。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "实时注册跟踪与设置操作的渐进式解锁。",
